      "spam": false,
      "value": "I think tournaments would be pretty bad-ass. The only thing I would contribute / add to this request would be perhaps a system / method of earning a title of \"Honorable\" through a qualification rounds / period.\n\nEarning the \"Honorable\" title would require playing before a referee for screening. Once approved, the players are allowed to participate in tournament events etc. :)\n\nLeagues: Gladiator / Micro Gladiator.\n\n If players choose to use Micro Avatars, they could enter a \"Micro League\" to be matched against other players their own size. Otherwise, gladiators are required to have \"at least\" a human-sized avatar of average size and width. Going larger and wider is just fine - but probably offers a significant disadvantage.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
